      "id": "claim_f437d7fe91244a649fd3107fd65c1e58",
      "statement": "The taxable fixed-income sleeve comprises US Treasuries, agency MBS, investment-grade corporate credit, and municipal credit; non-US sovereign and emerging-market debt are assigned to the multi-asset sleeve.",
