    {
      "id": "claim_ea7daf18eb3843c292cb1bbb5f8196b3",
      "statement": "For taxable years beginning on or after 2026-01-01, Revenue Procedure 2025-41 sets AMT exemptions of $90,100 for an unmarried individual and $140,200 for joint filers or surviving spouses, with phase-out beginning at $500,000 and $1,000,000 respectively, while preserving the specified-private-activity-bond treatment and stated exceptions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
