    },
    {
      "id": "claim_44dfecc4d05e4b34a63489ae4f840f76",
      "statement": "Each target has a ±2-percentage-point market-value band measured at month end; ordinary drift beyond it is rebalanced at the next monthly cycle, and a weight outside its stated band requires approval.",
